<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Candle Grove Home Care</title>

  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      color: #20364a;
      background: #f7fbff;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #dbe8f4;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    .nav {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 18px 24px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0c3b66, #2b78a6);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: white;
      font-size: 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(12,59,102,.18);
    }

    .brand h1 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 25px;
      color: #0c3b66;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .brand span {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #5f7285;
    }

    nav a {
      margin-left: 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #20364a;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 720px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(247,251,255,.92), rgba(247,251,255,.88)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517486808906-6ca8b3f04846?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 70px 24px;
    }

    .hero-inner {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr;
      gap: 50px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 58px;
      line-height: 1.05;
      color: #0c3b66;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 19px;
      max-width: 620px;
      color: #385269;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #0c3b66;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #0c3b66;
      border: 1px solid #b7d4e8;
    }

    .hero-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.88);
      border: 1px solid #d8e9f5;
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 34px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(12,59,102,.14);
    }

    .hero-card h3 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 30px;
      color: #0c3b66;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .hero-card ul {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .hero-card li {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      padding-left: 28px;
      position: relative;
      color: #39566e;
    }

    .hero-card li::before {
      content: "✦";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: #2b78a6;
    }

    section {
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 46px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 42px;
      color: #0c3b66;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-title p {
      color: #5d7182;
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d8e9f5;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(12,59,102,.07);
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #0c3b66;
      font-size: 21px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .soft {
      background: #eaf5fc;
    }

    .about {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;
      gap: 44px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-image {
      min-height: 430px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(12,59,102,.12), rgba(12,59,102,.12)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556911220-bff31c812dba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(12,59,102,.13);
    }

    .about h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 42px;
      color: #0c3b66;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .about p {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #405a70;
    }

    .highlight {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-left: 5px solid #2b78a6;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      margin-top: 22px;
      color: #30495e;
    }

    .list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .list div {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d8e9f5;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #34516a;
    }

    .banner {
      background: #0c3b66;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 30px;
      padding: 44px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr;
      gap: 26px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .banner h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .faq-item {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d8e9f5;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .faq-item h3 {
      color: #0c3b66;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    form {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d8e9f5;
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 34px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(12,59,102,.07);
    }

    input, textarea, select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px;
      border: 1px solid #bfd8ea;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    textarea {
      min-height: 130px;
    }

    footer {
      background: #082b49;
      color: white;
      padding: 42px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    footer h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      nav {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero-inner,
      .about,
      .banner {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero h2 {
        font-size: 42px;
      }

      .grid,
      .list {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">♢</div>
      <div>
        <h1>Candle Grove</h1>
        <span>Home Care</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <nav>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#insurance">Insurance</a>
      <a href="#partners">Referral Partners</a>
      <a href="#careers">Careers</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div>
      <h2>Where care feels like home.</h2>
      <p>
        Dependable, compassionate non-medical home care designed around everyday life,
        comfort, dignity, and trust.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Request Care</a>
        <a href="#services" class="btn btn-secondary">View Services</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-card">
      <h3>Serving Northeast Ohio</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Personalized non-medical support at home</li>
        <li>Private pay care with flexible scheduling</li>
        <li>Referral-friendly communication for families and professionals</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <div class="container about">
    <div class="about-image"></div>

    <div>
      <h2>A calmer standard of home care.</h2>
      <p>
        Candle Grove Home Care provides dependable, compassionate, non-medical home services
        to help clients stay safely and comfortably in the place they know best — home.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our care is centered on warmth, trust, dignity, and steady communication with families.
        We support daily routines while helping clients feel seen, respected, and cared for.
      </p>

      <div class="highlight">
        Our mission is to provide dependable, compassionate, non-medical home services that
        help clients remain safe, comfortable, and supported at home.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="services" class="soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Home Care Services</h2>
      <p>Support for everyday living, companionship, and personal comfort.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="list">
      <div>Companionship</div>
      <div>Light Housekeeping</div>
      <div>Meal Preparation</div>
      <div>Medication Reminders</div>
      <div>Bathing & Hygiene Support</div>
      <div>Laundry Assistance</div>
      <div>Errands & Transportation</div>
      <div>Respite Support for Families</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="insurance">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Payment & Insurance Options</h2>
      <p>We help families understand care options and prepare for the right payment path.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Private Pay</h3>
        <p>
          Flexible care plans for families who want dependable support without waiting for
          insurance approval.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Long-Term Care Insurance</h3>
        <p>
          Many policies may help cover non-medical home care. Families should contact their
          insurer to confirm benefits and eligibility.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Veterans & VA Care</h3>
        <p>
          We are preparing to support veterans and families seeking care options through VA-related
          programs and community resources.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="highlight">
      Candle Grove Home Care is preparing for future Ohio Medicaid and PASSPORT waiver provider
      participation as the agency grows.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="partners" class="soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="banner">
      <div>
        <h2>For Families & Referral Partners</h2>
        <p>
          We welcome conversations with families, hospitals, social workers, discharge planners,
          case managers, and community partners.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Start a Referral</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="careers">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Caregiver Careers</h2>
      <p>Join a home care team built on compassion, reliability, and respect.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Caregiver Roles</h3>
        <p>Support clients with companionship, daily routines, light housekeeping, errands, and personal care.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Dependable Scheduling</h3>
        <p>We value reliable caregivers who communicate clearly and treat every client with dignity.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Apply Today</h3>
        <p>Use the contact form below and select “Caregiver Application.”</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Do you provide medical care?</h3>
      <p>No. Candle Grove Home Care provides non-medical home care services.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Do you offer private pay services?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Private pay is currently a main focus and allows families to schedule care based on their needs.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Are you a Medicaid or PASSPORT provider?</h3>
      <p>We are preparing for future Ohio Medicaid and PASSPORT waiver provider participation as the agency grows.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Contact Candle Grove Home Care</h2>
      <p>Request care, ask a question, start a referral, or apply as a caregiver.</p>
    </div>

    <form action="mailto:YOUR-EMAIL-HERE" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
      <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Full Name" required>
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email Address" required>
      <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Phone Number">

      <select name="reason">
        <option value="">How can we help?</option>
        <option>Request Home Care</option>
        <option>Family Question</option>
        <option>Referral Partner</option>
        <option>Caregiver Application</option>
        <option>Insurance / Payment Question</option>
      </select>

      <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us what you need help with..."></textarea>

      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send Message</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <h2>Candle Grove Home Care</h2>
  <p>Where care feels like home.</p>
  <p>Serving Northeast Ohio</p>
  <p>Phone: YOUR PHONE | Email: YOUR EMAIL</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
